{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/db264aabb221376bb11ec3e08aa67a2e.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> is an immersive third-person open-world RPG created by a passionate team that values the essence of classic old-school RPGs and modern designs. Explore the lands of a once-prosperous island, hone your combat skills, and survive in the unforgiving realm of the Kingdom of the Seven. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/77201c384669e6b2e45a4f21b975d276.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to stand up for yourself using different combat stances, environments, and active skills. Tailor your fighting style to suit you, from the agile rapier wielder to a heavy armour-clad knight, or create something unique! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.poster.avif?t=1761579101\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.webm?t=1761579101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/6df5659c3852a86d69036800aa61699f.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain strength, survive, and forge alliances. Prove that even someone who has lost everything can become a significant force that can shape the fate of the whole island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.poster.avif?t=1761579101\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.webm?t=1761579101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/f9a100c7567d4e9dd60b274c9c0d092f.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of Ash and Steel has no marker system, and quests won't lead you by the hand. Rediscover the joy of exploration and let curiosity be your guide; the world promises rich rewards for those who dare to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.poster.avif?t=1761579101\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.webm?t=1761579101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2893820?t=1761579101","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761579101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/95d9e758397fd5557b255ecc667e59b529919706/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1761579101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/95d9e758397fd5557b255ecc667e59b529919706/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1761579101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3708420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/db264aabb221376bb11ec3e08aa67a2e.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Of Ash and Steel</strong> is an immersive third-person open-world RPG created by a passionate team that values the essence of classic old-school RPGs and modern designs. Explore the lands of a once-prosperous island, hone your combat skills, and survive in the unforgiving realm of the Kingdom of the Seven. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/77201c384669e6b2e45a4f21b975d276.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to stand up for yourself using different combat stances, environments, and active skills. Tailor your fighting style to suit you, from the agile rapier wielder to a heavy armour-clad knight, or create something unique! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.poster.avif?t=1761579101\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/4965f6e65bf3f3c8c6b0f730ee87e238.webm?t=1761579101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/6df5659c3852a86d69036800aa61699f.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain strength, survive, and forge alliances. Prove that even someone who has lost everything can become a significant force that can shape the fate of the whole island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.poster.avif?t=1761579101\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/a4bf5751883f962913cce9229b8c8c9a.webm?t=1761579101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/f9a100c7567d4e9dd60b274c9c0d092f.avif?t=1761579101\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of Ash and Steel has no marker system, and quests won't lead you by the hand. Rediscover the joy of exploration and let curiosity be your guide; the world promises rich rewards for those who dare to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.poster.avif?t=1761579101\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/extras/6ba15af355d4e594240d6c6d4039aee9.webm?t=1761579101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Fire & Frost"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893820/cfa077ad8f331fd8ba6177287ac89759a84baac8/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1761579101","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2893820/2113680804/3f93ac0ecfaca859263ba7ddc87c55e481f30189/1755759552/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756178210","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2893820/2113680804/3f93ac0ecfaca859263ba7ddc87c55e481f30189/1755759552/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756178210","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2893820/2113680804/3f93ac0ecfaca859263ba7ddc87c55e481f30189/1755759552/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756178210","id":257186493,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186493/movie480.mp4?t=1756178210","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186493/movie_max.mp4?t=1756178210"},"name":"Gameplay Overview Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s